            "padding_top_desktop": "desktop:pt-0",
            "padding_bottom_desktop": "desktop:pb-0",
            "max_width_desktop": "135ch",
            "richtext": "<p>Damp basements breed bacteria, and that is exactly the problem the<a href=\"https://www.blueair.com/products/blue-pure-311i-plus-max\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Blue Pure 311i+ Max</span></a> was built to address. The 311i+ Max is the only model in the current lineup with GermShield technology, which actively prevents bacterial growth on the filter surface even when the unit is powered off. For a basement that sits empty between uses, that protection matters.</p><p>Coverage is 525 ft²  in 12.5 minutes with a CADR of Pollen 446 cfm, Dust 370 cfm, Smoke 339 cfm. The unit also includes voice control (Alexa and Google Assistant), auto mode, night mode, and app control. Filter life runs about 9 months, and a<a href=\"https://www.blueair.com/pages/subscribe\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">filter subscription</span></a> saves 15% on every replacement.</p><h3><strong>Pick #3: Blueair Blue Pure 311i Max, Best Value Mid-Range</strong></h3>",
            "richtext_alignment": "text-left",
            "richtext_style": "p2"
          }
        },
        "image_caption_dTfPej": {
          "type": "image_caption",
          "settings": {
