            "padding_top_desktop": "desktop:pt-0",
            "padding_bottom_desktop": "desktop:pb-0",
            "max_width_desktop": "135ch",
            "richtext": "<p>Not every basement needs voice control or GermShield. The<a href=\"https://www.blueair.com/products/blue-pure-311i-max\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Blue Pure 311i Max</span></a> covers </p><p>439 ft² in 12.5 minutes at a CADR of Pollen 365 cfm, Dust 314 cfm, Smoke 283 cfm, and includes auto mode with a PM2.5 sensor, night mode, and app control. For a standard basement used for laundry, storage, or occasional hangouts, the 311i Max handles the job reliably at a lower price.</p><p>The SmokeBlock filter upgrade is worth considering here if odors are a persistent issue. The enhanced activated carbon layer targets smoke, cooking smells, and musty basement air more aggressively than the standard particle and carbon<a href=\"https://www.blueair.com/collections/air-purifier-filters\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">filter</span></a>.</p><h3><strong>Pick #4: Blueair Blue Signature™, Best for Finished Basements</strong></h3>",
            "richtext_alignment": "text-left",
            "richtext_style": "p2"
          }
        },
        "image_caption_FXXwrz": {
          "type": "image_caption",
          "settings": {
            "margin_top_mobile": "mt-0",
            "margin_bottom_mobile": "mb-0",
