        "text_RTfjHc": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "margin_top_mobile": "mt-0",
            "margin_bottom_mobile": "mb-0",
            "padding_top_mobile": "pt-0",
            "padding_bottom_mobile": "pb-0",
            "margin_top_desktop": "desktop:mt-0",
            "margin_bottom_desktop": "desktop:mb-0",
            "padding_top_desktop": "desktop:pt-0",
            "padding_bottom_desktop": "desktop:pb-0",
            "max_width_desktop": "135ch",
            "richtext": "<p>A basement that doubles as a home theater, gym, playroom, or guest suite is a living space, not a storage area. The<a href=\"https://www.blueair.com/products/blue-signature\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"> Blue Signature</span></a> treats the air accordingly. Coverage goes up to 705 sq ft in 12.5 minutes, and the CADR reaches 455 CFM for smoke. Seven stages of filtration combined with OdorFence technology deliver 10x more odor removal than a standard particle filter, which is exactly what a finished basement used for cooking, exercise, or entertaining needs.</p><p>The design also fits a finished room. A motion-activated touchscreen, compact footprint, and tabletop-doubling form factor mean the Blue Signature looks like a piece of furniture, not a piece of equipment tucked behind a shelf.</p><h3><strong>Pick #5: Blueair Blue Pure 511i Max, Best for Small Basements and Utility Rooms</strong></h3>",
            "richtext_alignment": "text-left",
            "richtext_style": "p2"
          }
        },
        "image_caption_aEef9V": {
          "type": "image_caption",
          "settings": {
            "margin_top_mobile": "mt-0",
            "margin_bottom_mobile": "mb-0",
            "padding_top_mobile": "pt-0",
            "padding_bottom_mobile": "pb-0",
            "margin_top_desktop": "desktop:mt-0",
            "margin_bottom_desktop": "desktop:mb-0",
            "padding_top_desktop": "desktop:pt-0",
            "padding_bottom_desktop": "desktop:pb-0",
            "max_width_desktop": "1096px",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/image3_68529c5a-755a-4471-a968-9f2abd58d445.jpg",
            "image_desktop": "shopify://shop_images/image3_68529c5a-755a-4471-a968-9f2abd58d445.jpg",
